Question ID 1606
Title Conception after spontaneous abortion
Category Obstetrics / Gynecology > Obstetrics > Failed pregnancy
() Flag as important
Adele is a 23-year-old primigravida woman who had a spontaneous abortion at 12 weeks gestation
two weeks ago. She has presented to you because she wants to have another pregnancy as soon
as possible as she thinks this could help her husband and her get over their loss. She asks you
